---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="The Team" description="The people behind BARK — an initial spark and growing circle of contributors.">
  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="pt-32 pb-16 px-6 lg:px-10">
    <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
      <span class="text-label text-accent reveal">Who We Are</span>
      <h1 class="text-headline text-bark-800 mt-4 max-w-3xl reveal" data-delay="100">
        A spark, not a hierarchy.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-body-lg text-bark-500 mt-6 max-w-2xl reveal" data-delay="200">
        BARK started with one person asking a question and acting on the answer. It grows
        through contributors who bring skills, conviction, and skin in the game. There are
        no passive founders here — only people who build.
      </p>
      <div class="accent-line mt-10 max-w-xl reveal" data-delay="300"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Initial Spark + Contributors -->
  <section class="pb-24 px-6 lg:px-10">
    <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
      <span class="text-label text-bark-400 reveal">Initial Spark &amp; Contributors</span>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-bark-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden mt-8">
        <!-- Drow -->
        <div class="bg-bark-50 p-10 reveal" data-delay="100">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-bark-800 flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="font-display font-bold text-bark-50 text-lg">D</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-800 text-xl">Drow Dvorkin</h2>
              <span class="text-label text-accent">Initial Spark</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-bark-600 leading-relaxed">
            Twenty years travelling the world, building communities as temporary autonomous zones,
            and helping businesses grow to multimillion-dollar revenue in compressed timescales.
            CEO of <a href="https://nuanu.realestate/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-dim">Nuanu Real Estate</a>
            in Bali — developing a 44-hectare sustainable creative district with 400+ residential
            and hospitality units. Founded
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/gravity-agency" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-dim">Gravity</a>,
            a social asset management agency helping brands build real audience relationships. Co-founded
            <a href="http://zerogravityagency.us/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-dim">Zero Gravity</a>,
            a consultancy accelerating growth for investors and entrepreneurs. Consulted for
            <a href="https://hungryminds.be/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-dim">Hungry Minds</a> and
            <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AnchorFree" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-dim">AnchorFree</a>
            (creators of Hotspot Shield, 650M+ downloads, used during the Arab Spring).
          </p>
          <p class="text-bark-500 mt-4 leading-relaxed text-sm">
            Now applying two decades of community-building and business systems experience to
            something more permanent than a temporary autonomous zone: a physical community designed
            to sustain itself. The person who asked the question, wrote the first line of code,
            and is assembling the team to answer it.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-bark-200">
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li class="text-bark-500 text-sm pl-5 relative before:content-[''] before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.6em] before:w-2 before:h-px before:bg-accent">
                Real estate development (Nuanu — 44ha, 400+ units, Bali)
              </li>
              <li class="text-bark-500 text-sm pl-5 relative before:content-[''] before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.6em] before:w-2 before:h-px before:bg-accent">
                Founded Gravity, co-founded Zero Gravity — agency &amp; consulting
              </li>
              <li class="text-bark-500 text-sm pl-5 relative before:content-[''] before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.6em] before:w-2 before:h-px before:bg-accent">
                Consulted: Hungry Minds, AnchorFree (650M+ downloads)
              </li>
              <li class="text-bark-500 text-sm pl-5 relative before:content-[''] before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.6em] before:w-2 before:h-px before:bg-accent">
                20+ years global community building &amp; TAZ experience
              </li>
              <li class="text-bark-500 text-sm pl-5 relative before:content-[''] before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.6em] before:w-2 before:h-px before:bg-accent">
                Infrastructure, AI systems &amp; automation
              </li>
              <li class="text-bark-500 text-sm pl-5 relative before:content-[''] before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.6em] before:w-2 before:h-px before:bg-accent">
                <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/homototus" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-dim">LinkedIn</a> &middot; <a href="https://nuanu.realestate/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-dim">Nuanu Real Estate</a>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Oleg -->
        <div class="bg-bark-50 p-10 reveal" data-delay="200">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-bark-800 flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="font-display font-bold text-bark-50 text-lg">O</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-800 text-xl">Oleg</h2>
              <span class="text-label text-accent">Contributor</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-bark-600 leading-relaxed">
            Systems thinker and knowledge architect who sees patterns where others see chaos.
            Designed the NetworkTribes dimensional cosmos — a framework for organizing knowledge
            across multiple conceptual axes — which powers BARK's <a href="/en/explore" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 decoration-accent/30 hover:decoration-accent">/explore</a> page.
          </p>
          <p class="text-bark-500 mt-4 leading-relaxed text-sm">
            Background in community design and information architecture.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-bark-200">
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li class="text-bark-500 text-sm pl-5 relative before:content-[''] before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.6em] before:w-2 before:h-px before:bg-accent">
                Vision & conceptual architecture
              </li>
              <li class="text-bark-500 text-sm pl-5 relative before:content-[''] before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.6em] before:w-2 before:h-px before:bg-accent">
                Knowledge systems & information design
              </li>
              <li class="text-bark-500 text-sm pl-5 relative before:content-[''] before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.6em] before:w-2 before:h-px before:bg-accent">
                Community frameworks & governance
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Advisors & Allies -->
  <section class="pb-24 px-6 lg:px-10">
    <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
      <span class="text-label text-bark-400 reveal">Advisors & Allies</span>
      <div class="mt-8 p-10 bg-bark-100 rounded-xl border border-bark-200 reveal" data-delay="100">
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-800 text-xl mb-4">Building our advisory network</h3>
        <p class="text-bark-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          We're actively connecting with people who have experience in cooperative law, sustainable
          agriculture, off-grid infrastructure, Bolivian business, and community governance. We don't
          have a formal advisory board yet — we'd rather build real relationships than collect names.
        </p>
        <p class="text-bark-500 mt-4 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl text-sm">
          If you have relevant expertise and want to help shape this project's direction, we'd
          love to talk. Visit our <a href="/en/community" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 decoration-accent/30 hover:decoration-accent">community page</a>
          to connect.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What we need -->
  <section class="bg-bark-900 py-24 px-6 lg:px-10">
    <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
      <span class="text-label text-accent reveal">What We Need</span>
      <h2 class="text-title text-bark-100 mt-4 max-w-2xl reveal" data-delay="100">
        Two people can start a project.<br />It takes a team to build a community.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-body-lg text-bark-400 mt-6 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed reveal" data-delay="200">
        We're looking for co-creators — not employees, not followers. People who see the same
        risks, share the same values, and want to put skin in the game. Early participants
        shape everything: governance, culture, priorities, physical design.
      </p>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-12">
        <div class="p-6 bg-bark-800/50 rounded-lg reveal" data-delay="100">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-100">Engineers</h3>
          <p class="text-bark-400 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Solar, water systems, construction, communications infrastructure.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-bark-800/50 rounded-lg reveal" data-delay="150">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-100">Agriculturalists</h3>
          <p class="text-bark-400 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Permaculture, tropical farming, food preservation, soil science.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-bark-800/50 rounded-lg reveal" data-delay="200">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-100">Legal & Governance</h3>
          <p class="text-bark-400 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Bolivian cooperative law, international structures, community governance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-bark-800/50 rounded-lg reveal" data-delay="250">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-100">Medical</h3>
          <p class="text-bark-400 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Remote healthcare, emergency medicine, community health programs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-bark-800/50 rounded-lg reveal" data-delay="300">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-100">Educators</h3>
          <p class="text-bark-400 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Teaching, curriculum design, skills transfer, language instruction.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-bark-800/50 rounded-lg reveal" data-delay="350">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-100">Builders & Makers</h3>
          <p class="text-bark-400 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Construction, fabrication, 3D printing, workshop operation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- AI Team -->
  <section class="pb-24 px-6 lg:px-10">
    <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
      <span class="text-label text-bark-400 reveal">AI Team</span>
      <h2 class="text-title text-bark-800 mt-4 mb-4 reveal" data-delay="100">
        How a 2-person team operates at 20-person capacity.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-bark-600 mb-6 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed reveal" data-delay="200">
        This is not a gimmick. A 2-person team with 25 specialized AI agents operates at
        20-person capacity. BARK's hybrid model is itself an experiment in human-AI
        collaboration — and a proof of concept for the community's approach to technology.
      </p>
      <p class="text-bark-500 mb-10 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-sm reveal" data-delay="300">
        The AI team is led by Nous Aeternos, with 25 specialized sub-agents. They have names,
        roles, and responsibilities. Humans provide presence, judgment, relationships, and
        physical work. AI provides tireless research, monitoring, analysis, and coordination.
        Neither is sufficient alone.
      </p>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-px bg-bark-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden reveal" data-delay="400">
        <div class="bg-bark-50 p-8">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-800">Research & Intelligence</h3>
          <p class="text-bark-500 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Market research, legal research, partner identification, competitive analysis.
            Agents: Cortex, Quant, Juris, Scout.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bark-50 p-8">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-800">Content & Translation</h3>
          <p class="text-bark-500 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Website copy, Spanish translations, documentation, social media drafts.
            Agents: Herald, Scribe, Sophia.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bark-50 p-8">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-800">Financial Modeling</h3>
          <p class="text-bark-500 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Profit projections, investment scenarios, budget analysis, grant applications.
            Agents: Quant, Strategos.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bark-50 p-8">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-800">Knowledge Management</h3>
          <p class="text-bark-500 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Dimensional cosmos, cross-referencing, fact-checking, source verification.
            Agents: Sage, Sophia, Scribe, Veritas.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bark-50 p-8">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-800">Infrastructure Monitoring</h3>
          <p class="text-bark-500 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Server health, security scanning, uptime tracking.
            Agents: Atlas, Sentinel, Vigil.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bark-50 p-8">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-800">Design & Visualization</h3>
          <p class="text-bark-500 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            UI/UX audits, design system maintenance, image sourcing.
            Agents: Designer, Architect.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-bark-100 rounded-xl p-8 mt-8 border border-bark-200 reveal" data-delay="500">
        <p class="text-bark-600 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          <strong class="text-bark-800">A clear boundary:</strong> AI agents inform and execute. They never decide.
          Every financial model, every public communication, every strategic recommendation
          goes through human review. The AI team amplifies human judgment — it does not
          replace it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Open Positions -->
  <section class="bg-bark-900 py-24 px-6 lg:px-10">
    <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
      <span class="text-label text-accent reveal">Open Positions</span>
      <h2 class="text-title text-bark-100 mt-4 mb-4 reveal" data-delay="100">
        Critical human roles we need to fill.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-bark-400 mb-12 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed reveal" data-delay="200">
        AI handles research and coordination. But someone needs to walk the land, build the
        structures, teach the classes, and know the neighbors by name. These are the roles
        no AI can fill.
      </p>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-bark-800/50 rounded-lg p-6 reveal" data-delay="100">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-100">Project Director</h3>
          <p class="text-bark-400 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Strategic direction, partnerships, fundraising. Final decision-maker on land acquisition and major expenditures.</p>
          <span class="inline-block mt-4 text-[0.6rem] text-accent font-display font-medium tracking-widest uppercase">On-site, travel-heavy</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bark-800/50 rounded-lg p-6 reveal" data-delay="150">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-100">Solar / Energy Engineer</h3>
          <p class="text-bark-400 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Design, install, maintain off-grid solar arrays and battery storage. Size systems for Yungas climate. Explore micro-hydro.</p>
          <span class="inline-block mt-4 text-[0.6rem] text-accent font-display font-medium tracking-widest uppercase">On-site</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bark-800/50 rounded-lg p-6 reveal" data-delay="200">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-100">Permaculture Designer</h3>
          <p class="text-bark-400 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Food forests, terraced gardens, composting, agroforestry. Design for Yungas subtropical climate at 1,700m elevation.</p>
          <span class="inline-block mt-4 text-[0.6rem] text-accent font-display font-medium tracking-widest uppercase">On-site, seasonal flexibility</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bark-800/50 rounded-lg p-6 reveal" data-delay="250">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-100">Trading House Manager</h3>
          <p class="text-bark-400 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Import/export operations. Coffee, cacao, crafts out; supplies and equipment in. Build fair trade network relationships.</p>
          <span class="inline-block mt-4 text-[0.6rem] text-accent font-display font-medium tracking-widest uppercase">On-site + La Paz travel</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bark-800/50 rounded-lg p-6 reveal" data-delay="300">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-100">Legal Counsel (Bolivia)</h3>
          <p class="text-bark-400 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Bolivian cooperative law, land title verification, immigration, coca regulation. Fluent in both formal and communal legal systems.</p>
          <span class="inline-block mt-4 text-[0.6rem] text-accent font-display font-medium tracking-widest uppercase">La Paz-based, periodic on-site</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bark-800/50 rounded-lg p-6 reveal" data-delay="350">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-100">Community Health Worker</h3>
          <p class="text-bark-400 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Primary care, preventive health, first aid training. Tropical disease awareness. Coordinate with Coroico hospital and La Paz services.</p>
          <span class="inline-block mt-4 text-[0.6rem] text-accent font-display font-medium tracking-widest uppercase">On-site</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bark-800/50 rounded-lg p-6 reveal" data-delay="400">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-100">Education Coordinator</h3>
          <p class="text-bark-400 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Community learning programs: languages, technical skills, children's education. Coordinate with Carmen Pampa University (12 km).</p>
          <span class="inline-block mt-4 text-[0.6rem] text-accent font-display font-medium tracking-widest uppercase">On-site</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bark-800/50 rounded-lg p-6 reveal" data-delay="450">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-bark-100">Communications Director</h3>
          <p class="text-bark-400 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Public narrative, press relations. Translate BARK's vision into compelling stories for builders, investors, allies, and local community.</p>
          <span class="inline-block mt-4 text-[0.6rem] text-accent font-display font-medium tracking-widest uppercase">Remote possible</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-32 px-6 lg:px-10">
    <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-headline text-bark-800 reveal">Want to join the founding team?</h2>
      <p class="text-body-lg text-bark-500 mt-4 reveal" data-delay="100">
        We're not looking for perfect resumes. We're looking for people who care enough to build.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/en/participate"
        class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 mt-8 px-7 py-4 bg-bark-800 text-bark-50 font-display font-semibold text-sm tracking-wide rounded hover:bg-bark-900 transition-colors duration-300 reveal" data-delay="200"
      >
        Get Involved
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
